. T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691464","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4844350-1846651706676082","game_id":"steam-4844350","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out","summary":"The Anomagram demo is now available. You can download and play it right now. The demo covers the first three nights of the full game's eight-night contract, and takes about 15 minutes. The anomalies are drawn at random, so the same three nights play differently next time. Interface available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and Korean. The full game is planned for Q4 2026. Add it to your wishlist to get notified at launch. https://store.steampowered.com/app/5254350/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:02:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676082","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4844350-1844751498233866","game_id":"steam-4844350","kind":"announcement","title":"New trailer","summary":"A new trailer for Anomagram is out. Your job: just watch the \"videos.\" Report any anomaly. The full game is planned for Q4 2026. Add it to your wishlist to get notified at launch.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T11:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233866","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4844350-1844115010501391","game_id":"steam-4844350","kind":"announcement","title":"The Anomagram Demo store page is live","summary":"The store page for the Anomagram demo is now up. The demo covers the first three nights of the full game's eight-night contract. Six posts arrive each night, and the three nights take about 20 minutes. The anomalies are drawn at random, so the same three nights play differently next time. Interface in English and Japanese. Coming soon The demo becomes downloadable soon. For now you can follow the demo page - you'll get a notification the moment it goes live. The full game is planned for Q4 2026.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T13:29:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4844350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4844350":"2026-10-26T14:50:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4844350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:42Z"},"5254350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:50:43Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4844350","app_id":4844350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:02Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f15608b4a13f6f344ffbc084b676a4c58e2675ea5fef29c01da1095457735484","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"『Anomagram』은 심야 감시 근무를 무대로 한 이상 현상 찾기 호러 게임입니다. 자정. 오늘 밤에도 남의 일상이 들어온다. 지급받은 업무용 단말기에 올라오는 숏폼 영상을 하나씩 '승인' 또는 '신고'로 분류하는 것. 그게 일의 전부일 터였습니다. 그중에는 정상이 아닌 영상이 섞여 있습니다. 이상 현상은 영상 안에만 머물지 않습니다. 단말기에도, 당신에게도 번집니다. 계약 기간은 8일.","publishers":[{"name":"Hot Tea Works","creator_clan_account_id":46595131}],"developers":[{"name":"Hot Tea Works","creator_clan_account_id":46595131}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Anomagram Trailer 202609 EN","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790655639","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/1790654568/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/1790654568/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/1790654568/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/1790654568/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/1790654568/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257430475/f23bc5ad8fad7f4dbf7028248e9ce43c92dedd94/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257430475/f23bc5ad8fad7f4dbf7028248e9ce43c92dedd94/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1337612,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["Hot Tea Works"],"publishers":["Hot Tea Works"],"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Anomagram Trailer 202609 EN","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790655639","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4844350/1250356275/c82d10d69b408bc08b808e3bd3a9f96483b2fdec/179